# Work4You — copy visível ao utilizador

Read `docs/LINGUAGEM.md` and `docs/PRODUTO.md` (Analogia).

When writing **user-facing** text (UI, i18n, site, toasts, errors shown in chat):

- Say **Work4You** — not Wayne, Wayne Agent, Motor Wayne, or Hermes as the product.
- Engine/API text shown to users must pass through `sanitizeProductCopy()` from `@hermes/shared` / `@wayne/shared`.

Internal paths (`wayne-agent/`, `WAYNE_HOME`, Fly `wayne-*`) are fine in code — never surface them as the product name.

Before shipping i18n or public copy, run: `node scripts/check-user-facing-brand.mjs`
